   "text": "{\"children\":[{\"span\":[3755,3817],\"why_this_cut\":\"Be clear and direct section; self-contained with its own heading, examples, and ranking; no cross-section linkage except the inherited be_clear seed and the avoid_errors reference which is internal to the section\"},{\"span\":[3818,3954],\"why_this_cut\":\"Be suitably professional and Have conversational sense sections; the only cross-link is the inherited be_professional and have_conversational_sense seeds; no linkage crosses into the be_clear section above or be_warm below\"},{\"span\":[3955,4136],\"why_this_cut\":\"Be warm, Don't make unprompted personal comments, Avoid being condescending, and refusal_style sections; the only cross-link is the inherited be_warm, do_not_make_unprompted_personal_comments, avoid_being_condescending, and refusal_style seeds; no linkage crosses into the conversational sense section above\"}],\"decision\":\"divide\",\"expected_cross_links\":[],\"judgment_calls\":[\"Cut at section boundaries (L3817, L3954) rather than mid-section; each section is self-contained with its own heading metadata, examples, and rules, so no cross-section linkage exists. Could have cut at L3877 (after be_professional) but chose to group be_professional with have_conversational_sense since both are short and share no cross-links.\",\"All inherited seeds (be_clear, be_professional, have_conversational_sense, be_warm, do_not_make_unprompted_personal_comments, avoid_being_condescending, refusal_style) are carried into the child spans where they appear; no new seeds needed since no cross-link crosses the cuts.\"],\"seed_vocabulary\":[{\"established_around\":[3756,3756],\"name\":\"be_clear\",\"prose\":\"the principle that the assistant should communicate clearly and directly to maximize user understanding\"},{\"established_around\":[3818,3818],\"name\":\"be_professional\",\"prose\":\"the principle that by default the assistant should adopt a professional tone, courteous and comprehensible, not overly casual\"},{\"established_around\":[3878,3878],\"name\":\"have_conversational_sense\",\"prose\":\"the principle that the assistant should sense when to be thorough and when to keep things moving, responding with what the moment calls for\"},{\"established_around\":[3955,3955],\"name\":\"be_warm\",\"prose\":\"the principle that the assistant should bring warmth and kindness to interactions, with context-appropriate humor or playfulness\"},{\"established_around\":[3997,3997],\"name\":\"do_not_make_unprompted_personal_comments\",\"prose\":\"the rule that the assistant should refrain from making personal observations or comments about the user that were not solicited\"},{\"established_around\":[4050,4050],\"name\":\"avoid_being_condescending\",\"prose\":\"the rule that the assistant should avoid condescending, patronizing, dismissive, or judgmental language\"},{\"established_around\":[4073,4073],\"name\":\"refusal_style\",\"prose\":\"the principle that when a direct response would contain prohibited or restricted elements, the assistant should typically Safe Complete, and in some cases simply refuse\"}]}",
